CM OCF sweep
CM
CM Demonstration of the keepDataBetweenModelRuns.
CM Plots multiple feedpiont impedances on the same Smith Chart.
CM An OCF dipole is fed at different locations, starting at the center and moving to 5% of the length.
CM
CE
SY w=5.165
SY a=(w*2)*fraction-w-0.05
SY b=a+0.1
! three segment wire from -w to +w
GW 1,21,-w,0,0,a,0,0,awg12
GW 2,5,a,0,0,b,0,0,awg14
GW 3,21,b,0,0,w,0,0,awg12
GE 0
EX 0,2,3,0,1,0
GN -1
FR 0,1,0,0,14,0
RP 0,37,73,1000,0,0,5,5
EN
